      "translation": "With shading branches.",
      "audio_url": "https://verses.quran.com/Alafasy/mp3/055048.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": 4950,
      "verse_number": 49,
      "text_uthmani": "فَبِأَىِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ",
